#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:109 f928d56e4afd44fcb2ac73b60ee2340a
msgid ""
"You can select a \"My Image\" / \"My Mosaic\" result, preview it on the map "
"and start the processing from it exactly like from any other search result:"
