#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:280 9bdc0838821f47459ee157b4a9f40488
msgid ""
"You can add a new AOI to an existing search, modify the geometry, or delete "
"areas that have already been processed. After any AOI changes, you will need"
" to confirm these changes. The search will be updated, and the **results "
"will be synchronized** accordingly."
msgstr ""
"您可以将新的 AOI 添加到现有搜索、修改几何图形或删除已处理的区域。任何 AOI 更改后，您需要确认这些更改。搜索将更新，**结果将相应同步**。"

#: 008dfb267ab44ce89fed81f95eb70a3e
msgid "Update template"
msgstr "更新模板"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:290 4c4d483469c94a339afd2ca834266851
msgid "**You can also change the search criteria for the existing search:**"
msgstr "**您还可以更改现有搜索的搜索条件：**"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:292 c868f17f72c444afa817157b2673211e
msgid ""
"\"View on the map\" → Adjust the search parameters → \"Search Imagery\" → "
"\"Save as schedule\". Now the background search will work according to the "
"new parameters."
msgstr "“在地图上查看”→调整搜索参数→“搜索图像”→“另存为计划”。现在后台搜索将根据新参数进行工作。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:303 9889c1b0e51844e983b4ef6103d3c6dc
msgid "Using Mapflow Imagery Search in QGIS"
msgstr "在 QGIS 中使用 Mapflow 图像搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:305 8c257c760f3649c5a7a0956f47754228
msgid ""
"Switch to the tab \"Imagery Search\". To start the search, set the dates and"
" the product type filters (\"Mosaic\" – Imagery basemaps like ArcGIS or "
"Global mosaic and/or \"Images\" - Satellite imagery archives)"
msgstr ""
"切换到“图像搜索”选项卡。要开始搜索，请设置日期和产品类型过滤器（“马赛克”- 影像底图，如 ArcGIS 或全球马赛克和/或“图像”- 卫星影像档案）"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:306 88378337bfa749bca7e867ac9e5a54c8
msgid ""
"Set additional filters like a minimum intersection with your area of "
"analysis."
msgstr "设置额外的过滤器，例如与分析区域的最小交集。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:307 3b732c8d96034cc2908445f4ecf5b8b8
msgid ""
"If there is non-empty response, it will add the **🔎 Imagery Search "
"metadata** layer to your QGIS project. You can select one or multiple "
"results in the table - or use the layer's attribute table to start the "
"analysis and processing with Mapflow models."
msgstr ""
"如果有非空响应，它将添加 **🔎 Imagery Search 元数据** 图层到您的 QGIS 项目。您可以在表中选择一个或多个结果 - "
"或使用图层的属性表开始使用 Mapflow 模型进行分析和处理。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:316 9ccd513e442f4fb59dd97a0ed174afbb
msgid ""
"In the Arcgis search results you see the zoom level at which the mosaic is "
"available over you area. You can configure the table columns in the "
"Settings."
msgstr "在 Arcgis 搜索结果中，您可以看到您所在区域的马赛克可用的缩放级别。您可以在“设置”中配置表格列。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:326 9ce3bf51eb7f48a2a2b9a584035f0cbd
msgid ""
"👉 See :ref:`Mapflow <> QGIS` for more information on how to use Imagery "
"Search in Mapflow Web and QGIS plugin."
msgstr "👉 有关如何在 Mapflow Web 和 QGIS 插件中使用图像搜索的更多信息，请参阅:ref:`Mapflow <> QGIS`。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:329 6477415c91104bccb2fc39d3a833536a
msgid "Planned Search in QGIS"
msgstr "QGIS 中的计划搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:331 82d13ebca2444ad1a73adb37873ea9fc
msgid ""
"**Planned Search** is a recurring background search. You define the search "
"area and parameters once, and Mapflow keeps looking for new imagery over "
"that area - you will be notified when new images are found. The search runs "
"in the background, so you can keep working with the plugin in the meantime, "
"review the results at any time and start processing directly from them."
msgstr ""
"**计划搜索**是重复的后台搜索。您定义一次搜索区域和参数，Mapflow 会不断在该区域寻找新图像 - "
"找到新图像时您将收到通知。搜索在后台运行，因此您可以同时继续使用该插件，随时查看结果并直接从中开始处理。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:334 769a9dc1d95c4095a35ae69c49e1b798
#, fuzzy
msgid "Creating a planned search"
msgstr "如何创建预定搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:336 72238d6e8b32448ab13fb55a0cb3b1df
msgid ""
"Switch to the **Imagery Search** tab and set the area of interest: draw it "
"on the map or select an existing polygon layer (for example, a GeoJSON file "
"loaded into QGIS). If the layer has a ``name`` attribute, it will be used as"
" the AOI name. AOI names can also be assigned or changed later."
msgstr ""
"切换到 **影像搜索** 选项卡并设置感兴趣的区域：将其绘制在地图上或选择现有的多边形图层（例如，加载到 QGIS 中的 GeoJSON "
"文件）。如果图层具有“name”属性，它将用作 AOI 名称。 AOI 名称也可以稍后分配或更改。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:337 c1c8145ada2c4c599cdeaa83bee631dd
msgid ""
"Set the search parameters: date range, cloud cover, off-nadir angle, minimum"
" intersection, product types and providers."
msgstr "设置搜索参数：日期范围、云量、偏离最低点角度、最小交叉点、产品类型和提供商。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:338 5cbb3705804447d5a6826f087fa5380e
msgid "Specify the search name in the **Processing name** field."
msgstr "在 **处理名称** 字段中指定搜索名称。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:339 79cadbcfdda3457198feae9ce1a6abd2
msgid "Open the **Search** button menu and choose **Plan search**."
msgstr "打开 **搜索** 按钮菜单并选择 **计划搜索**。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:348 2298439f93324f9eb08f3b85fdcc42df
msgid ""
"The planned search is created and starts running in the background. It will "
"keep looking for new imagery over the selected areas, and you will be "
"notified when results are ready."
msgstr "计划的搜索已创建并开始在后台运行。它将继续在选定区域寻找新图像，结果准备就绪后，您将收到通知。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:350 1871362899244b53b7a5f771130f0aea
msgid ""
"The planned search appears in the **Processing** table with the workflow "
"**\"Planned\"**. Its status reflects the search state:"
msgstr "计划的搜索将显示在 **处理** 表中，工作流程为 **“已计划”**。它的状态反映了搜索状态："

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:352 3aef5aaa0cc8456ea442dd56e3324e21
msgid "**Searching** – the initial search is in progress;"
msgstr "**搜索中** – 初始搜索正在进行中；"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:353 0611c493ed4f434f94eaab32e4c86eb9
msgid ""
"**Created / Updated** – the search is active and being checked for new "
"imagery (the number of new images, e.g. *Updated (3)*, is shown when there "
"are any);"
msgstr "**创建/更新** – 搜索处于活动状态并正在检查新图像（新图像的数量，例如*更新（3）*，当有任何图像时显示）；"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:354 8a289820dda646e09b2ba1b56907369f
msgid "**Inactive** – the search is paused;"
msgstr "**非活动** – 搜索已暂停；"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:355 b95632e4c5b44132b52d8a62b1f3bd3e
msgid "**Failed** – the search failed and can be restarted."
msgstr "**失败** – 搜索失败，可以重新启动。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:365 d565dbb27b744a1c9b1a996a997fce30
msgid ""
"If the area of interest is too large for an immediate search, clicking "
"**Search** will prompt you to create a planned search instead - the search "
"area would take too long to process synchronously. Confirm with **Plan "
"Search**, and the planned search will be created and run in the background."
msgstr ""
"如果感兴趣的区域太大而无法立即搜索，则单击“**搜索**”将提示您创建计划的搜索 - 搜索区域将需要很长时间才能同步处理。单击 **计划搜索** "
"进行确认，计划的搜索将在后台创建并运行。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:373 2db6c7fbd260458389db35d150861d73
#, fuzzy
msgid "Opening a planned search"
msgstr "打开预定搜索"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:375 2cba16d216394df38d291411ee9355b0
msgid "right_arrow"
msgstr "右箭头"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:379 61d673abc81446eb8e2960709f97f008
msgid ""
"Select the planned search in the **Processing** table and click the "
"|right_arrow| navigation button (or double-click the row). The plugin enters"
" the planned search view: the table now shows the search AOIs, each followed"
" by the processings that were launched for it, and the **\"No AOI\"** group "
"for processings not linked to any area."
msgstr ""
"在 **Processing** 表中选择计划的搜索，然后单击 "
"|right_arrow|导航按钮（或双击该行）。该插件进入计划的搜索视图：该表现在显示搜索 AOI，每个 AOI 后面跟着为其启动的处理，以及**“无"
" AOI”** 组，用于未链接到任何区域的处理。"

#: ../userguides/imagery_search.rst:388 882ff9ac48ef498389774bc69315e26c
msgid ""
"The AOI rows show the aggregate status of their processings (*OK (n)*, *In "
"progress*, *Failed*). On the map, the planned search is displayed in a "
"dedicated group in the Layers panel — each AOI and its processings are "
"grouped together, and processings not tied to any AOI appear on the map when"
